Project: Sam Hackathon – Frontend

Rules:
- Do not create tests unless explicitly asked.
- After each edit, re-check imports and function signatures.
- Keep the Next.js setup minimal (App Router, TypeScript, no heavy UI libs unless requested).
- Prefer absolute paths for tool calls and file references.
- Long-running dev servers should run in the background.
- Use commit messages that include the AI marker suffix: [ai:y].
- Keep UI clean and modern; dark theme by default.
- Avoid adding bloat (Tailwind/shadcn/etc.) unless requested.
- For Git pushes, prefer HTTPS with short-lived PAT when SSH is unavailable.
